Subject: [PATCH 08/11] mach-mediatek: Introduce mediatek-mobile board

[dianqk: resolved against the MT6897-only Kconfig above (no MT6878
entry, no MTK_SMC_JUMP). MT6878-Mainline 015dd6becc, which this commit
partly reverts in mt6897/init.c, is not taken, so that hunk is already
present; board/mediatek/mtk-phone.env does not exist here.]
(cherry picked from commit 5d29b1066c73dc794ff8bbe6744165f2a20fadcd)
